This project provides AWS Neuron (NKI) kernel implementations of the Gated
DeltaNet linear-attention operator used by the Qwen3.5-family hybrid
architecture (model_type: qwen3_5_moe).

The reference math and operator semantics follow the Qwen3.5 model
architecture published by Alibaba Cloud / the Qwen team:
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B
Qwen models are released under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This repository contains original kernel code (the NKI implementations and
their PyTorch custom-op registrations); it does not redistribute any Qwen model
weights.
